## Prohibited Uses

Licensee may NOT:

- Resell, redistribute, sublicense, or share the source code of the Software
  itself (as opposed to the product built with it)
- Use the Software to build a competing boilerplate, starter kit, or scaffolding tool
- Allow multiple developers to use the same license — each developer requires
  their own license (e.g., a team of 4 needs 4 licenses)
- Remove or obscure copyright notices

## Multi-Developer / Team

For teams of more than one developer, a **Team License** is required (5 seats)
or an **Enterprise License** (unlimited seats). Contact the author for pricing.

